&lt;h2 id="流程图flowchart">流程图(Flowchart)&lt;/h2>
&lt;pre class="mermaid">flowchart LR
A[Hard] --&amp;gt;|Text| B(Round)
B --&amp;gt; C{Decision}
C --&amp;gt;|One| D[Result 1]
C --&amp;gt;|Two| E[Result 2]
&lt;/pre>
&lt;p>&lt;details class="custom-collapse" open>
&lt;summary markdown="span">
&lt;span>Flowchart&lt;/span>
&lt;span class="line-count">7 lines&lt;/span>
&lt;/summary>
&lt;div class="content">
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#282a36;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>\```mermaid
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>flowchart LR
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>A[Hard] --&amp;gt;|Text| B(Round)
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>B --&amp;gt; C{Decision}
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>C --&amp;gt;|One| D[Result 1]
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>C --&amp;gt;|Two| E[Result 2]
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>\```
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/details>&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="序列图sequence-diagram">序列图(Sequence diagram)&lt;/h2>
&lt;pre class="mermaid">sequenceDiagram
Alice-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;John: Hello John, how are you?
loop HealthCheck
John-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;John: Fight against hypochondria
end
Note right of John: Rational thoughts!
John--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Alice: Great!
John-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Bob: How about you?
Bob--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;John: Jolly good!
&lt;/pre>
&lt;p>&lt;details class="custom-collapse" open>
&lt;summary markdown="span">
&lt;span>Sequence diagram&lt;/span>
&lt;span class="line-count">11 lines&lt;/span>
&lt;/summary>
&lt;div class="content">
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#282a36;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>\```mermaid
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>sequenceDiagram
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>Alice-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;John: Hello John, how are you?
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>loop HealthCheck
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> John-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;John: Fight against hypochondria
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>end
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>Note right of John: Rational thoughts!
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>John--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Alice: Great!
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>John-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Bob: How about you?
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>Bob--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;John: Jolly good!
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>\```
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/details>&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="甘特图gantt-chart">甘特图(Gantt chart)&lt;/h2>
&lt;pre class="mermaid">gantt
section Section
